  "notes": "USAGE:\n{抜粋|ばっすい} is used with する as a transitive suru-verb. The source takes から, and the selected content takes を.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {一部|いちぶ}を{抜粋|ばっすい}する (to excerpt a part)\n- {記事|きじ}の{抜粋|ばっすい} (excerpt from an article)\n- {抜粋|ばっすい}{版|ばん} (abridged edition)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {抜粋|ばっすい}: excerpt, extract (formal, selecting from a text)\n- {引用|いんよう}: quotation, citation (reproducing someone else's words with attribution)\n- {要約|ようやく}: summary (condensing the overall content)",
